        "title": "Deals: M5 Pro MacBook Pro 24GB $500 off, 48GB $400 off, Find My charger $40, AirPods, more",
        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/07/27/deals-macbook-pro-find-my-charger-airpods/",
