        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/07/23/ios-27-gives-apple-photos-a-very-useful-feature-ive-wanted-for-years/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/06/apple-photos-app-icon-ios-27.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Apple Photos gets a <a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/06/16/heres-everything-new-for-apple-photos-in-ios-27/\">variety of exciting upgrades in iOS 27</a>, including a new feature that’s long been on my wishlist: the ability to save a video frame as a photo.</p>",
