        "url": "https://www.oreilly.com/radar/stranded-in-the-slow-zone/",
        "content_text": "Gene Kim was grilling dinner for his family on the evening of June 12 when his phone told him that Fable 5 was no longer available. He’d heard the day before from Steve Yegge that the model was going away in 10 days, and he’d spent that first day starting on a plan to get [&#8230;]",
