        "url": "https://www.oreilly.com/radar/the-economics-of-agentic-ai-engineering-for-imperfection/",
        "content_text": "The price of adoption euphoria You played entirely by the book. You procured the most capable enterprise models, mandated adoption across your teams, and put the right metrics in place. The promise was a predictable boost in efficiency. And at first, it delivered. The demos were flawless. The prototypes worked. The agents reasoned with a [&#8230;]",
