        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/06/carplay-ios-27-home-screen-car.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">iOS 27 is launching <a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/06/08/ios-27-release-date-when-next-major-iphone-update-is-coming/\" type=\"post\" id=\"1047043\">this fall</a>, and it brings a handful of improvements for CarPlay. Here’s everything new for CarPlay in iOS 27.</p>",
