        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/07/22/apple-promotes-two-limited-time-offers-to-save-on-new-products/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/07/apple-sales-tax-holidays-store.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Apple recently <a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/06/25/apple-price-increases-mac-ipad-more/\">raised prices</a> on many of its products, but the company is now promoting two ways for shoppers to save on new hardware purchases: <a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/07/15/apple-highlights-2026-sales-tax-holidays-for-macs-ipads-and-more-in-10-states/\">sales tax holidays</a> and a <a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/07/16/apple-store-back-to-school-gift-card-deal-promo/\">Back to School deal</a>.</p>",
