        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/07/23/apple-tv-announces-its-first-dating-series-the-last-person-on-earth/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2025/10/apple-tv-tvos26-screensaver-07.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Dating reality shows are a popular genre Apple TV has entirely avoided. And while its <a href=\"https://www.apple.com/tv-pr/news/2026/07/apple-tv-announces-groundbreaking-new-dating-documentary-series-the-last-person-on-earth-with-renowned-relationship-expert-esther-perel/\">newly announced series</a>, The Last Person on Earth, is being billed as a “documentary series” rather than “reality,” it’s the streamer’s first dating show nonetheless.</p>",
