        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/07/23/two-new-macs-might-skip-m5-chips-and-go-straight-to-m6/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2025/10/m6_regular.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Yesterday <em>Bloomberg’s</em> Mark Gurman <a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/07/22/apples-huge-mac-roadmap-revealed-in-new-report/\">detailed a years-long roadmap</a> for upcoming Macs, and per his report, it sounds like two new models might skip the base M5 chip and go straight to M6.</p>",
